# sUPI v3.3 TDP: repository exclusions

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Native mechanical CAD
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Creo part, drawing, assembly and format files are not released. The STEP
# models and the PDF drawings are the released mechanical data.
sUPI Mechanicals/*.prt.1
sUPI Mechanicals/*.drw.1
sUPI Mechanicals/*.asm.1
sUPI Mechanicals/*.frm.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CAD session artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Creo session trails and logs. None of them is design data.
sUPI Mechanicals/trail.txt.1
sUPI Mechanicals/*_log.xml

# KiCad working files: lock files (left behind if KiCad exits uncleanly),
# per-user view state (.kicad_prl), the footprint cache, and autosave
# backups / local history. None of them is design data.
sUPI Electrical/**/~*.lck
sUPI Electrical/**/*.kicad_prl
sUPI Electrical/**/fp-info-cache
sUPI Electrical/**/*-backups/
sUPI Electrical/**/.history/
sUPI Electrical/**/_autosave-*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Externally controlled document, not mirrored
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Picatinny CLIK Design Standard has its own revision history and point of
# contact. Request the current revision from the design activity; the docs
# summarise the interface envelope and cite it.
CLIK-Design-Standard-v3.pdf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded source documents
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Converted to Markdown; the .md versions are tracked.
sUPI Mechanicals/Change Log.docx

# Documentation is published as Markdown only. PDF copies of the briefs, MFR
# notes and other documents stay out of the repository, wherever they are put.
# Drawing and schematic PDFs in sUPI Mechanicals/ and sUPI Electrical/ are
# design data and are still tracked.
/*.pdf
Documentation/**/*.pdf
sUPI Electrical/MFR_*.pdf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .axf: debug ELF builds. The released image is build/supi_firmware.hex.
sUPI Firmware/**/*.axf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working record
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RELEASE_CHANGES.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
